  Year: 2016
  clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: ab204a5b71712264f9f249bf3e0f15aa, type: 3}
  creator:
  - Header: Laying the Foundation
    Description: "2016 marked the beginning of our journey. With a small but passionate
      team, we laid the groundwork for our vision\u2014focused on innovation, collaboration,
      and long-term impact. This was the year of bold ideas, big dreams, and the
      first steps toward building something meaningful."
  - Header: Where It All Began
    Description: "2016 was the year everything started\u2014an idea, a purpose, and
      a shared dream among a handful of passionate individuals. With minimal resources
      but an unwavering belief in what we could build, we laid the foundation of
      our company in a small workspace with big ambitions.  Our early days were filled
      with late nights, endless brainstorming sessions, and a relentless drive to
      turn concepts into reality. We built our first prototype, tested our assumptions,
      and listened closely to every bit of feedback. Each challenge we faced only
      strengthened our resolve.  More than just a starting point, 2016 was about
      defining our values\u2014innovation, integrity, and impact. These principles
      became the backbone of our culture and continue to guide us today. This was
      not just the beginning of a company, but the birth of a mission to create meaningful
      solutions and make a lasting difference."
